WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.835
Before you open the project page.

2
00:00:02.115 --> 00:00:19.181
Write one page answering five questions: what is fixed code and what is model-driven, and why; which tools exist and what each can reach; which trifecta legs are present and how you break or gate them; what the reviewer sees and decides; and how you will know it works, at what cost.

3
00:00:19.461 --> 00:00:23.941
Every rubric criterion on the project page maps to one of these answers.
